# Pango 1.57 runs fontconfig work on a GLib GAsyncQueue. The vcpkg
# GLib/Pango/fontconfig objects are not TSan-instrumented, so TSan cannot observe
# the external queue and font-cache synchronization. Keep every suppression at
# an exact external symbol; application frames remain fully instrumented and
# every other TSan report still stops the test job.
race:g_queue_pop_tail
race:fc_thread_func
race:pango_fc_is_supported_font_format
race:FcDirCacheMapFd
